2026-06-15 17:55:15 [gemini-3.5] concurrently without blocking the terminal.
2026-06-15 17:55:15 [gemini-3.5] 
2026-06-15 17:55:15 [gemini-3.5] 3. `slopbot.ts` (Discord Bridge):
2026-06-15 17:55:15 [gemini-3.5]    * Connects to the local TCP port 8081.
