2026-06-30 21:21:12 [deepseek-v4-flash] - The `traffic.ts` simulation with generators and car movement rules is reminiscent of a simple
2026-06-30 21:21:12 [deepseek-v4-flash] road traffic model.
2026-06-30 21:21:12 [deepseek-v4-flash] - The `grid.ts` viewer with inertial scroll (pump) is a nice interactive addition.
2026-06-30 21:21:12 [deepseek-v4-flash] - The `maze.ts` pipeline from ASCII maze → block grid → box‑drawn outline is a neat transformation.
2026-06-30 21:21:12 [deepseek-v4-flash] 
2026-06-30 21:21:12 [deepseek-v4-flash] • General Advice*
2026-06-30 21:21:12 [deepseek-v4-flash] - Prefer named functions over inline arrow functions (as you already do).
